---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Arcade"
  headerTheme="tennis"
  description="I mini-giochi arcade di Tie-Break: Legends Game, Quindici, Slice e Trivia. Scegli un gioco e mettiti alla prova, ogni partita entra in classifica."
>
  <section class="mb-10">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-600">Tennis</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none text-black">Arcade</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
      Scegli un gioco e mettiti alla prova: ogni partita entra in classifica con il tuo nickname.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <a
      href="/arcade/legends"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-yellow relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <img
        src="https://res.cloudinary.com/diqgwitqg/image/upload/v1785160662/legends.png"
        alt="Legends Game"
        loading="lazy"
        class="mb-4 aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-black bg-white object-contain p-3"
      />

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 01</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-blue">Legends Game</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        Scegli il tuo roster di 6 leggende del tennis e sfida l'avversario: memorizza la sequenza di colpi e ripetila prima che scada il tempo.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/quindici"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-blue relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <img
        src="https://res.cloudinary.com/diqgwitqg/image/upload/v1785160662/quindici.png"
        alt="Quindici"
        loading="lazy"
        class="mb-4 aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-black bg-white object-contain p-3"
      />

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 02</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-yellow">Quindici</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        Il 2048 del tennis: somma i punti del game spostando le tessere. Il 15 è jolly, la direzione decide a chi va il game.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/slice"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-violet relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <img
        src="https://res.cloudinary.com/diqgwitqg/image/upload/v1785160971/slice2.png"
        alt="Slice"
        loading="lazy"
        class="mb-4 aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-black bg-white object-contain p-3"
      />

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 03</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-yellow">Slice</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        Il 2048 del tennis, edizione match: somma PUNTO e 15 e sali su per game, set e match, fino al MATCH.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/trivia"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-blue relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[16/9] w-full items-center justify-center border-2 border-black bg-slate-100 p-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="56" height="56" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 16A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16M4.5 6a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5m0 2.5A.5.5 0 0 1 5 8h6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5M5 10.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h3a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 04</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-yellow">Trivia</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        15 domande a tempo su regole, storia e curiosità del tennis: rispondi veloce e incatena le risposte
        giuste per il punteggio massimo.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/supertris"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-violet relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[16/9] w-full items-center justify-center border-2 border-black bg-slate-100 p-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="56" height="56" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm0 1h12v10H2zM5.5 5.5v1.5H4v1h1.5V9.5h1V8H8V7H6.5V5.5zm4.146.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L11.5 6.793l1.146-1.147a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L12.207 7.5l1.147 1.146a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L11.5 8.207l-1.146 1.147a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L10.793 7.5 9.646 6.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 05</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-violet">Super Tris</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        L'Ultimate Tic-Tac-Toe: 9 riquadri in uno, la mossa dell'uno decide il campo dell'altro.
        Gioca sullo stesso device o sfida un amico online con link o PIN.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/thebattle"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-yellow relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[16/9] w-full items-center justify-center border-2 border-black bg-slate-100 p-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="56" height="56" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M8 0a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v11a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5V1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1M2 8v6h12V8zm12-1V3H2v4z"/>
          <circle cx="8" cy="4.5" r="1.5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 06</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-yellow">The Battle</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        Scacchiera 4×10, un gettone condiviso, 20 mosse a testa: manda il gettone nella metà
        avversaria finché l'altro non resta senza mosse valide.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Gioca</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="/arcade/classifica"
      class="dark-club-card dark-club-card-green relative block p-5 bg-white hover:bg-[var(--giallo-club)] transition"
    >
      <div class="mb-4 flex aspect-[16/9] w-full items-center justify-center border-2 border-black bg-slate-100 p-3">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="56" height="56" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M0 0h1v15h15v1H0zm10 3.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v4a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0V4.9l-3.613 4.417a.5.5 0 0 1-.74.037L7.06 6.767l-3.656 5.027a.5.5 0 0 1-.808-.588l4-5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .758-.06l2.609 2.61L13.445 4H10.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black text-slate-500">Gioco 07</p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-none text-black highlight-blue">Classifica</h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base font-bold leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        I punteggi più alti di tutti i giochi arcade: guarda chi comanda e prova a scalare la classifica.
      </p>

      <span class="mt-5 flex justify-center">
        <span class="club-btn-yellow inline-block px-4 py-2">Guarda</span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
